<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Вступление:
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'> – 4</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>p</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">             
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Туман
над Янцзы.<br />
<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">         
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Туман
над Янцзы.<br />
<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">          </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Душистый,
как шерсть<br />
<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>E</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Небесной
лисы.<br />
<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">          
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Я
выбросил
компас,<br />
<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">               
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Растоптал
в пыль часы<br />
<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       
</span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>И
вышел
плясать<br />
<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">               
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>В
туман над
Янцзы.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Над
рисовым
полем<br />
Сгустился
туман,<br />
В нём бродит
католик,<br />
И бродит
шаман.<br />
Бродят верха,<br />
И бродят
низы,<br />
Их скрыл друг
от друга<br />
Туман над
Янцзы.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>И я
был, как все,<br />
Пил да пахал.<br />
Прочёл Дао Дэ
Цзин<br />
И понял
"Попал!";<br />
Сжёг свой
пентхаус,<br />
Снял пробу с
лозы <br />
И вышел
плясать<br />
В туман над
Янцзы.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">             
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>Ответь,
Нижневартовск,<br />
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">            
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Em</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>И
Харьков,
ответь - <br />
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">              
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span>Давно
ль
по-китайски<br />
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">         
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>7<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>Вы
начали петь?<br />
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">          </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>H</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>7<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>И чья в
том вина,<br />
<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">               
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Em</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Что
арбатская
пьянь<br />
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">              
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>A</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>7<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>Пьёт
водку из чаш<br />
<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">         
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>7 <o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Династии</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'> </span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Тань</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>? <o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Проигрыш</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>: G C G C
G E Am Am Am D# D G G<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Мы
все теперь
братья,<br />
Мы все здесь
семья;<br />
Так кто из
нас ты<br />
И кто из нас я?<br />
Кто весел,
тот стар,<br />
А кто мрачен -
тот юн;<br />
<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">             
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>И
все хотят
знать:<br />
<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">             
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>D</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>7<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Так
о чём я пою?<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>А я
хожу и пою,<br />
И всё вокруг
Бог;<br />
Я сам себе
суфий<br />
И сам себе
йог.<br />
В сердце
печать<br />
Неизбывной
красы,<br />
А в голове<br />
Туман над
Янцзы.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
